
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "BalanceTransfer";
}
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="page-header">Balance Transfer</h1>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-10">
        <div class="panel panel-default panel-primary2">
            <div class="panel-heading">
                <div class="panel-body">
                    <div class="table-container">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-6">Current Year:</div>
                                    <div class="col-md-6"><span id="spnCurrentYear"></span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-6">Next Year:</div>
                                    <div class="col-md-6"><span id="spnNextYear"></span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-12">
                                        <button type="button" id="btnTransfer" class="btn btn-primary">Transfer</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-1">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <h2> Note:-</h2>

                                <p>Before transfer balances, please make a Journal Entry against Surplus/Deficit values in Transaction Master.Otherwise it will create Difference in Balance Sheet.  For more information contact to Account Administration in sectriate Office</p>

                                <p>If you already transfer balances into New Year. Now it will be removed  and new balances will be updated.</p>

                                <p>Any Income or Expenses Ledger's Opening Balance will be removed, if you mention opening balance.</p>
                                <p>Only Assets or Liabilities Ledger's Balances will be carrying forward. Into Next year.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-2">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="~/Scripts/CustomScripts/BalanceTransfer.js"></script>
